<para>Called by <ref refid="class_plugin_manager" kindref="compound">PluginManager</ref> before unloading during hot-reload. The returned state will be passed back to <ref refid="class_stateful_test_plugin_1a3514b4612d971a6cf585b65d975c5537" kindref="member">restoreState()</ref> after reload.</para>
